  "attribution": "The render thread is asleep 91.5 ms inside eglSwapBuffers -> queueBuffer: its buffer cannot be queued until the GPU finishes the previous frame (GPU completion fence 75: 108.0 ms, against 4.1-7.7 ms for the 12 frames before it). It is not a GC (none overlaps), not a lock, not preemption (0.3 ms). The slow GPU job belongs to the 10th frame after the course-switch frame in every switch measured, whatever that frame's CPU work: the switch frame is the only one with texture uploads (4 region tiles, 19.66 MB, replacing the previous region's 4 in AtlasArt.selectRegion). The cost is GPU-driver work on the driver's own schedule, 10 frames after the app replaces the region textures; the trace cannot split it between the 4 deletes and the 4 uploads."
